      "text": "Day 1",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "EavhucWYmr3Oyg1IxJs2b",
      "originalText": "Day 1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zmWWBR3pXA1qafgitQ_aY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 839.0283528477696,
      "y": 5875.665984024047,
      "width": 1166,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 882986458,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1433696533,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Imagine you are the first backend engineer at a startup.\n\nThe product owner says:\n\n    \"We want an AI Workspace where companies can manage projects, documents, tasks, and ask AI questions.\"\n\nYour job is not to start coding.\nYour first job is to understand the business.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Imagine you are the first backend engineer at a startup.\n\nThe product owner says:\n\n    \"We want an AI Workspace where companies can manage projects, documents, tasks, and ask AI questions.\"\n\nYour job is not to start coding.\nYour first job is to understand the business.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8i8TrcOdM0FilBvw_KziH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 819.7822590977696,
      "y": 6174.177702774047,
      "width": 506,
      "height": 875,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1112874438,
      "version": 43,
      "versionNonce": 1157303995,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Organizations\nOne user can belong to multiple organizations.\nAmit\n├── OpenAI\n├── Infosys\n└── Personal Workspace\n\n\nTeams\nInside organizations\nEngineering\nMarketing\nHR\nFinance\n\nProjects\nExample\nBackend API\nAI Module\nMobile App\nWebsite\n\nTasks\nEvery project contains\nTasks\nSubtasks\nComments\nAttachments\n\nAI\nLater\nChat\nSummarization\nReport Generation\nDocument Search",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Organizations\nOne user can belong to multiple organizations.\nAmit\n├── OpenAI\n├── Infosys\n└── Personal Workspace\n\n\nTeams\nInside organizations\nEngineering\nMarketing\nHR\nFinance\n\nProjects\nExample\nBackend API\nAI Module\nMobile App\nWebsite\n\nTasks\nEvery project contains\nTasks\nSubtasks\nComments\nAttachments\n\nAI\nLater\nChat\nSummarization\nReport Generation\nDocument Search",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UPEhBFHKdKEW3LmhJZBsO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 811.0283528477696,
      "y": 7144.665984024047,
      "width": 363,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 487736582,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1729007221,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Why is an Organization needed?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Why is an Organization needed?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GAh766WJjs-t8vBMk8rZI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 839.0283528477696,
      "y": 7179.544890274047,
      "width": 1045,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 511557146,
      "version": 16,
      "versionNonce": 1103069019,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "An Organization is the highest logical boundary (tenant) in the system. It isolates users, \nteams, projects, permissions, documents, AI knowledge, and settings so that one company's data \nis completely separate from another's.\n\nIt also stores company-specific information such as:\n\nName\nOwner\nBilling plan\nBranding\nAI configuration\nMembers\nTeams\nSecurity settings\n\nThink of it as the root container for everything.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "An Organization is the highest logical boundary (tenant) in the system. It isolates users, \nteams, projects, permissions, documents, AI knowledge, and settings so that one company's data \nis completely separate from another's.\n\nIt also stores company-specific information such as:\n\nName\nOwner\nBilling plan\nBranding\nAI configuration\nMembers\nTeams\nSecurity settings\n\nThink of it as the root container for everything.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "_e-SFfPudmBUq4pscZZZi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 795.0283528477696,
      "y": 7645.665984024047,
      "width": 539,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 209915482,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1535047637,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Can one user belong to multiple organizations?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Can one user belong to multiple organizations?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Wt2qJgYOVqhPV73KAFyzA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830.0283528477696,
      "y": 7676.665984024047,
      "width": 1045,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 52867206,
      "version": 69,
      "versionNonce": 1508695035,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The same user can participate in multiple workspaces(company, freelancing, personal workspace),\n each with different roles.\n\nAmit\n↓\nCompany A\n↓\nCompany B\n↓\nPersonal Workspace",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The same user can participate in multiple workspaces(company, freelancing, personal workspace),\n each with different roles.\n\nAmit\n↓\nCompany A\n↓\nCompany B\n↓\nPersonal Workspace",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8AsWOmJ7QdLntWUKCSyQl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 779.0283528477696,
      "y": 8002.665984024047,
      "width": 759,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 304761434,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 752563509,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Why does a project belong to a team instead of directly to a user?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Why does a project belong to a team instead of directly to a user?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5eCR2lIfxKk6s_tgFxs5m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 826.0283528477696,
      "y": 8033.665984024047,
      "width": 1034,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 554841030,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 159753371,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Projects outlive individual employees.\nIf a developer leaves the company, the project remains owned by the team rather than becoming \norphaned.\nThat's a key modeling decision.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Projects outlive individual employees.\nIf a developer leaves the company, the project remains owned by the team rather than becoming \norphaned.\nThat's a key modeling decision.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "z_CbADxQvK3BHPh9XM9lB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 784.0283528477696,
      "y": 8204.665984024046,
      "width": 418,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 640354266,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1988675221,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. What information should Task store?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. What information should Task store?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-axax2vt85kZEZjbiQjOp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 818.7588215977696,
      "y": 8239.540984024046,
      "width": 770,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 664809030,
      "version": 12,
      "versionNonce": 675043643,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A production task typically stores:\n\nTitle\nDescription\nStatus\nPriority\nAssignee\nReporter\nDue Date\nSprint\nLabels\nStory Points\nEstimated Time\nActual Time\nAttachments\nComments\nActivity History\nCreated By\nUpdated By\nCreated At\nUpdated At\n\nWe'll grow the model gradually rather than adding everything on Day 1.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A production task typically stores:\n\nTitle\nDescription\nStatus\nPriority\nAssignee\nReporter\nDue Date\nSprint\nLabels\nStory Points\nEstimated Time\nActual Time\nAttachments\nComments\nActivity History\nCreated By\nUpdated By\nCreated At\nUpdated At\n\nWe'll grow the model gradually rather than adding everything on Day 1.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
