    {
      "id": "fKggFT2DvhY61r9-i6CO2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 663.8916340977696,
      "y": 16699.517546524046,
      "width": 1012,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 811583962,
      "version": 30,
      "versionNonce": 2034565947,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is one you'll appreciate later because it shows AI as a service, not as a separate app.\n\n                  User asks AI\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 Django API\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 AI Service\n            ┌───────────┼────────────┐\n            │            │              │\n            ▼            ▼              ▼\n      Prompt Builder  RAG Search    LLM API\n            │            │              │\n            └───────────┴────────────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                AI Response Returned",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is one you'll appreciate later because it shows AI as a service, not as a separate app.\n\n                  User asks AI\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 Django API\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 AI Service\n            ┌───────────┼────────────┐\n            │            │              │\n            ▼            ▼              ▼\n      Prompt Builder  RAG Search    LLM API\n            │            │              │\n            └───────────┴────────────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                AI Response Returned",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
