      "text": "User\n │\n ▼\nOrganization\n │\n ▼\nOrganizationMember\n │\n ▼\nTeam\n │\n ▼\nTeamMember\n │\n ▼\nProject\n │\n ▼\nSprint\n │\n ▼\nTask\n │\n ▼\nComment",
