    {
      "id": "B57rh-Tu3PeQlC7aZS2c_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 638.3135090977696,
      "y": 19324.513640274046,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2062159924,
      "version": 75,
      "versionNonce": 821362549,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Yes\n\nReal-World Example\nProject:\nAI Enterprise Workspace\n\nDocuments could be:\n\nAI Enterprise Workspace\n\n\n├── HLD.pdf\n├── LLD.pdf\n├── API_Design.pdf\n├── Database_Schema.pdf\n├── Sprint_1_Report.pdf\n├── Architecture.png\n├── Meeting_Notes.docx=\n└── Requirements.pdf\n\nSo one project can definitely have many documents.\n\nDatabase Relationship\n           one to many\nProject (1)           Document (Many)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Yes\n\nReal-World Example\nProject:\nAI Enterprise Workspace\n\nDocuments could be:\n\nAI Enterprise Workspace\n\n\n├── HLD.pdf\n├── LLD.pdf\n├── API_Design.pdf\n├── Database_Schema.pdf\n├── Sprint_1_Report.pdf\n├── Architecture.png\n├── Meeting_Notes.docx=\n└── Requirements.pdf\n\nSo one project can definitely have many documents.\n\nDatabase Relationship\n           one to many\nProject (1)           Document (Many)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
